==Polish==

===Etymology===
(Note that there is no Polish word ''*chlujny''.) Related to {{cog|ru|холя||care, attention}}, {{m|ru|холуй||obsequious overattentive servant}}, and also {{cog|pl|schludny||neat, tidy}}, from {{m|pl|chludzić||to clean thoroughly, to have high standards of cleanliness}}.

